Package: bicorDCEA
Title: Biweight Midcorrelation Differential Co-expression Analysis
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "Payton",
           family = "Yau",
           email = "tungon@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-3283-0370"))
Description: Robust differential co-expression analysis using biweight 
    midcorrelation (bicor). Implements three complementary methods: 
    BMKC (module-level cliques), BMHT (gene-level rewiring), and 
    ROS-DET (pair-level correlation switching). The package supports 
    both bulk RNA-seq and single-cell RNA-seq (via pseudobulk) and 
    includes advanced features such as CLR transformation, spatial 
    domain iteration, and cross-species mode, making it particularly 
    suitable for microbial, spatial, and metatranscriptomic interaction 
    studies. Includes a comprehensive, cross-platform visualization suite 
    for plotting interactive network topologies, raincloud module 
    eigengenes, and dynamic rewiring trajectories.
